window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p>ACHE FOR ME: A betrayal leaves Izzy tempted to avoid men. Fate apparently has other plans—it tosses Cole in her path, and sexual chemistry instantly flares. They're both content to stick to a simple arrangement. Until they're not.</p> <p>MELT FOR ME: Cat agreed to a casual arrangement, though getting involved with a criminal wasn't the wisest idea. She is left with one option: walk away. But Danton doesn't easily part with what belongs to him.</p> <p>SHATTER FOR US: Briar Leighton can admit she's drawn to both the elegant Trace Lacroix and the rough-around-the-edges Kaleb Westley. Rational thought vacates the building when they offer her a night of unparalleled pleasure. Now she wants more, but the guys are anti-arrangement and rarely play with the same woman twice. [Warning: MFM]</p> <p>BURN FOR ME: As a teenager, Inaya had two aspirations: become a rock singer and marry her idol Kaiser Wolfe. Her first dream became a reality. As for her second, she shed that juvenile fantasy. Which is good or she'd be heartbroken over how badly their first meeting went. He's also her new neighbor. She agrees to an arrangement, but the lid begins to rattle until they become something else.</p> <p>Contains mature themes.</p>"; 
